@startuml Sequence Create Order
title Sequence Create Order (Alur Pemesanan)
skinparam style strictuml

actor "User (Mitra)" as User
boundary "Halaman Produk" as UI_Cart
boundary "Halaman Checkout" as UI_Checkout
control "Aplikasi (Logic)" as Provider
control "ApiClient" as API
control "Server Backend" as Backend
entity "Database" as DB
boundary "Tripay (Pembayaran)" as Gateway

autonumber

' --- Phase 1: Add to Cart ---
User -> UI_Cart: Pilih Produk & Jumlah
activate UI_Cart
UI_Cart -> Provider: Tambah ke Keranjang
activate Provider
Provider -> Provider: Update Data Keranjang
Provider --> UI_Cart: Update Tampilan (Badge)
deactivate Provider
deactivate UI_Cart

' --- Phase 2: Checkout ---
User -> UI_Checkout: Klik Tombol Checkout
activate UI_Checkout
UI_Checkout -> Provider: Ambil Item Keranjang
activate Provider
Provider --> UI_Checkout: List Barang Siap Bayar
deactivate Provider

User -> UI_Checkout: Cek Alamat & Total Harga
UI_Checkout -> UI_Checkout: Pastikan Stok Ada
UI_Checkout -> User: Tampilkan Total Bayar

' --- Phase 3: Payment & Order Creation ---
User -> UI_Checkout: Klik "Bayar Sekarang"
UI_Checkout -> API: Proses Pesanan
activate API

API -> Backend: Kirim Data Pesanan ke Server
activate Backend

Backend -> DB: Simpan Order (Status: Pending)
activate DB
DB --> Backend: Order Tersimpan
deactivate DB

Backend -> Gateway: Minta Link Pembayaran
activate Gateway
Gateway --> Backend: Ini Link Pembayarannya
deactivate Gateway

Backend --> API: Kirim Link ke Aplikasi
deactivate Backend

API --> UI_Checkout: Buka Halaman Pembayaran
deactivate API

' --- Phase 4: User Pays ---
UI_Checkout -> Gateway: Muncul Halaman Bayar
User -> Gateway: Transfer / Bayar
Gateway --> User: Pembayaran Sukses!

' --- Phase 5: Finalization ---
Gateway -> Backend: Lapor ke Server (Callback)
activate Backend
Backend -> DB: Ubah Status jadi 'Sedang Proses'
activate DB
DB --> Backend: Status Terupdate
deactivate DB
deactivate Backend

UI_Checkout -> UI_Checkout: Pindah ke Halaman Sukses
UI_Checkout --> User: Tampilkan "Pesanan Berhasil"
deactivate UI_Checkout

@enduml
